# The reprobuild-packages catalog. repro.nim's `uses: "codetracer >=0"`
# compiles ../codetracer/repro.nim into this recipe, and that recipe names
# catalog packages (`shellcheck`, `sqlite3`, ...) that reprobuild's stdlib no
# longer bundles, so every `repro exec` here needs the catalog beside the
# checkout. repro.lock already pins it, but `repro develop --all` does not
# clone it (runquota's flake.nix pins it by recipe, which a bulk selection
# never substitutes); a declared entry is what hands it to clone-siblings at
# the committed lock revision.
reprobuild-packages
